ion, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ -3 & 6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{1\\cdot 6-(-3)\\cdot (-3)}\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299897 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2a42f8a6-1e37-57a1-b79b-0cce8c469322" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297727}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297727} :answer-field/id #uuid "0b99c9b7-8141-513a-be20-c36278c7181b" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298674} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6ab85a44-bb7a-5cec-baac-c94cdc7f03c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298012}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298012} :answer-field/id #uuid "0bca34ff-10f7-54a1-8911-6da5d5a9f405" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298675} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "605996f9-7b1c-5027-a349-ec460dcea071" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{14}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297959}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297959} :answer-field/id #uuid "f0436739-3f0b-5dcf-a103-f00d9db91e71" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299448}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "60c87e6d-fc63-5e6e-a2b2-0ff3158c1fb1" :question/math-academy-id "q-320792" :question/problem "The solution to the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-3y &=5 \\\\ 4x+y &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n| $x=$ {{field-1}} |\n| --- |\n\n| |  | $1$ | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | $2$ |  | |  |  |  | |  | $5$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-2$ |  | | . |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $1$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-3}} | $2$ |  |  |  |\n|  | $5$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $-2$ |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "This system can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{2\\cdot 1-4\\cdot (-3)}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{14}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{14}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299898 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "960f349d-7838-5c9a-9141-b9d7c0ce8182" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{12}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298200}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298200} :answer-field/id #uuid "5d72e67d-fd9b-5471-a511-22593e6e9c32" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298958} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b188f180-bb1a-5831-b8c8-0b16b64765b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298326}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298326} :answer-field/id #uuid "c941273a-0b94-5217-9096-d268ca535ad8" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299312} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "37655d8f-a19e-5cb6-9da0-6645a5e1409f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297776}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297776} :answer-field/id #uuid "d35f93d6-bedc-555d-b1a5-3d24d0287516" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299355}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "6ddd9d97-94ee-584a-8c5b-9c16696049ef" :question/math-academy-id "q-320797" :question/problem "The solution to the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4x-6y &=9 \\\\ 3y &=-3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n| $x=$ {{field-1}} |\n| --- |\n\n| |  | $3$ | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | $4$ |  | |  |  |  | |  | $9$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-3$ |  | | . |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $3$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-3}} | $4$ |  |  |  |\n|  | $9$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $-3$ |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "This system can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}9 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{4\\cdot 3-0\\cdot (-6)}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}9 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299899 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ed8c3408-9709-5ddb-8def-c078831ec1c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298562}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298562} :answer-field/id #uuid "237c6539-4411-5ad7-8031-3f8edaf565c6" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298754} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "51e738f2-a49d-5bc3-baca-e3236c9d02ad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297898}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297898} :answer-field/id #uuid "66c38295-8821-52ed-ae87-bf5e93d4f39d" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298985} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1ae0221e-1368-590e-b437-b5eac248c32a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297670}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297670} :answer-field/id #uuid "8ffb626f-a92d-5184-a68a-b6d957bf1da4" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299113}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "f32b9d41-3197-5ac1-bd1f-a220e0c2f816" :question/math-academy-id "q-320801" :question/problem "The solution to the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}5y &=6 \\\\ 2x-y &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n| $x=$ {{field-1}} |\n| --- |\n\n| |  | {{field-2}} | $-5$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-2$ | {{field-3}} |  | |  |  |  | |  | $6$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-7$ |  | | . |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} | $-5$ |  |  |  |\n|  | $-2$ | {{field-3}} |  |  |  |\n|  | $6$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $-7$ |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "This system can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{0\\cdot (-1)-2\\cdot 5}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -5 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{10}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -5 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{10}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -5 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299900 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9a6daa68-067f-5b3c-a3fc-4c4f63d8b357" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298226}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298226} :answer-field/id #uuid "40fabe15-e539-5832-ae0c-0398ba1d1