rix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{1\\cdot 2-5\\cdot 4}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -4 \\\\ -5 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{18}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -4 \\\\ -5 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{18}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -4 \\\\ -5 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299903 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "62223187-3535-5ced-bf2f-281fcdc0b75d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297970}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297970} :answer-field/id #uuid "4864b4e5-2627-5511-b80f-18e6432445f9" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298882} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a6670d69-76ee-530f-b59c-41cbaabe2627" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{14}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298281}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298281} :answer-field/id #uuid "700dd9c1-286a-5a21-b2cd-03627763d22d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299015} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7109bf86-a3fa-5fb0-bc66-d15e803c47c0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298039}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298039} :answer-field/id #uuid "cb24170f-cf32-56fb-8