e in the right order, to get\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4x-y &=5 \\\\ x+3y &=2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can represent this system of equations in the form $Ax=b:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{4\\cdot 3-1\\cdot (-1)}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{13}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{13}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299905 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f457c67a-a649-5300-b733-a6a3d7293588" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298590}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298590} :answer-field/id #uuid "5eaa4cb5-a40c-56aa-ba65-4658611d179b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298961} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1dc969f3-ec35-513b-a6e8-a774ed0952ad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297680}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297680} :answer-field/id #uuid "799c0051-ae72-56e8-b9c3-146782b5519a" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299053} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "27d6a72c-1dff-577e-849f-900fd3e85f9d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297721}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297721} :answer-field/id #uuid "c6fb8ef6-11b5-56f8-87c7-44fdda3a1f97" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299307}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "963a7f3f-2112-5c95-85ab-958b0db31a33" :question/math-academy-id "q-320811" :question/problem "The solution to the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2y &=7-3x \\\\ x+1 &=-2y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n| $x=$ {{field-1}} |\n| --- |\n\n| |  | {{field-2}} | $-2$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | $3$ |  | |  |  |  | |  | $7$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-1$ |  | | . |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} | $-2$ |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-3}} | $3$ |  |  |  |\n|  | $7$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $-1$ |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, we reorganize the equations so that they are in the right order, to get\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+2y &=7 \\\\ x+2y &=-1.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can represent this system of equations in the form $Ax=b:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{3\\cdot 2-1\\cdot 2}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299909 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bf6e471d-837e-5baf-91dc-1a3582938b55" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298394}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298394} :answer-field/id #uuid "35c55ffc-0294-561c-a0f7-2a8e87521060" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298824} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "020e0f0d-d42c-5b5c-8257-252945685d7e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{12}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297568}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297568} :answer-field/id #uuid "5d6aa461-a89a-5912-ae30-46f922ab5b44" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298957} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0da762bc-0470-5a53-8566-0408a5927eb3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297617}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297617} :answer-field/id #uuid "c93cc016-8b20-516c-af83-95e5abf8b571" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299311}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "4fd1af2b-5abb-5719-b412-392f65801ff2" :question/math-academy-id "q-320836" :question/problem "The solution to the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4x+8 &=0 \\\\ x &=7+3y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n| $x=$ {{field-1}} |\n| --- |\n\n| |  | $-3$ | $0$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-1$ | {{field-2}} |  | |  |  |  | |  | {{field-3}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $7$ |  | | . |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-3$ | $0$ |  |  |  |\n|  | $-1$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-3}} |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $7$ |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, we reorganize the equations so that they are in the right order, to get\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4x+0y &=-8 \\\\ x-3y &=7.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can represent this system of equations in the form $Ax=b:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{4\\cdot (-3)-1\\cdot 0}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{12}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{12}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299910 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "862d1024-b1ee-5d1b-bccd-fe3564ba0538" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298132}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298132} :answer-field/id #uuid "36b9900e-2d14-5ff7-8f9b-3dc202a50204" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298825} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "359923bb-41ad-5a22-8110-231c9af62b6d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{11}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297766}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297766} :answer-field/id #uuid "5ed86c5f-7a2e-5792-a0c7-774b7f6dc479" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298963} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f4093295-e6fc-503d-b1c7-c5949de5c759" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298587}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298587} :answer-field/id #uuid "b6c89783-6eef-5c80-81bf-8abaab3d9452" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299254}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "47e2d599-891b-5344-82a3-b9ce814d6215" :question/math-academy-id "q-320842" :question/problem "The solution to the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3y-2x &=5 \\\\ x &=-1-4y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n| $x=$ {{field-1}} |\n| --- |\n\n| |  | {{field-2}} | $-3$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | $-2$ |  | |  |  |  | |  | $5$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-1$ |  | | . |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} | $-3$ |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-3}} | $-2$ |  |  |  |\n|  | $5$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $-1$ |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, we reorganize the equations so that they are in the right order, to get\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x+3y &=5 \\\\ x+4y &=-1.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can represent this system of equations in the form $Ax=b:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{(-2)\\cdot 4-1\\cdot 3}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -3 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{11}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -3 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{11}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -3 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299911 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e974c234-2745-5a8a-8b60-ace815e198d1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298544}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298544} :answer-field/id #uuid "6d594158-9b0d-5f6b-9519-9a1687aa57ea" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299001} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "657f2568-783a-5703-b3fd-c4acec9e64db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297985}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297985} :answer-field/id #uuid "923b66ba-005e-5664-80de-a084dc03c9a4" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299121} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "25ee4537-cdc6-5cd3-824d-cb987fd4527a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297710}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297710} :answer-field/id #uuid "eb9ca3c4-c50d-556e-8b08-de663407ce6e" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299435}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "9e717507-c51a-5c1c-8601-5f1355a3dc79" :question/math-academy-id "q-320847" :question/problem "The solution to the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=-1 \\\\ 4x &=6-y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n| $x=$ {{field-1}} |\n| --- |\n\n| |  | {{field-2}} | $-2$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-4$ | {{field-3}} |  | |  |  |  | |  | $-1$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $6$ |  | | . |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} | $-2$ |  |  |  |\n|  | $-4$ | {{field-3}} |  |  |  |\n|  | $-1$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $6$ |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, we reorganize the equations so that they are in the right order, to get\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=-1 \\\\ 4x+y &=6.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can represent this system of equations in the form $Ax=b:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{1\\cdot 1-4\\cdot 2}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{7}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{7}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302055 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2ac90acb-2dc9-54df-ad8c-312064a7ee7f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300169} {:answer/id #uuid "315aba2d-f457-5a05-b918-8c2570f4c19c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300202} {:answer/id #uuid "816e41d5-294b-558a-af5d-f694f628fb45" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300604} {:answer/id #uuid "b0b95442-5450-5ba2-81c3-3cc3170c4991" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300844} {:answer/id #uuid "c1631744-e68d-559c-aebe-8320a2681927" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=-\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300933}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186300604} :answer-field/id #uuid "8ad3e83e-9373-58ed-96e2-a904708a78e4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301665}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "1aea68ff-444c-5905-8fef-602bfd366d39" :question/math-academy-id "q-32135" :question/problem "Which of the following represents the solution to the system of linear equations given below?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-y &=-5 \\\\ 2x+3y &=5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "This system can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{1\\cdot 3-(-1)\\cdot 2}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302056 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "65fc8fdb-173a-56fc-9e8c-7c0062a13f89" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=-\\frac{1}{27}\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300477} {:answer/id #uuid "781de7f7-ed17-5d2a-8888-c6ff5b0f73e3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\frac{1}{27}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300554} {:answer/id #uuid "b0e50c02-2e93-5b2d-a7ec-37c3630092ed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=-\\frac{1}{29}\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300845} {:answer/id #uuid "bf0e9df6-89fd-54d3-92ec-7191d4adcc5f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\frac{1}{29}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300916} {:answer/id #uuid "c88644e1-845f-51f5-9007-9b4fd70a4064" :answer/ty